  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "The Transform class manages the spatial properties (position, rotation, scale) of entities within a 3D scene graph. It encapsulates local and world-space transformations using model matrices (mat4) and supports hierarchical relationships via parent/children pointers. It implements serialization via JsonSerializable, allowing state persistence, and provides methods for manipulating position, rotation, and scale in both local and world coordinate systems."
  },
